From 37bdfd204156a78d0da26800914af80a0898a887 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:08:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dicts: Settings page strings, Warden counter card, Download /
 Upload nouns

RWFP_40-66 for Wireless > Settings (RWFP_12 and RWFP_44 dropped: stale text
and the removed "Also on" sentence). RWDN_102-108 for the Warden card and the
"Blocked packets" stat; RWDN_44 dropped. RTRF_78/79 Download / Upload seeded
per pack from InternetSpeed_Download / InternetSpeed_Upload, the Russian
values overridden with the nouns; the Russian RTRF_75/76 lose the torrent
slang for the standard word. All 25 packs in lockstep at 7019 lines.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
